sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant J as GitHub Actions job
    participant T as GitHub OIDC provider
    participant STS as AWS STS
    participant R as IAM role trust policy

    J->>T: request ID token (permissions: id-token: write)
    T-->>J: JWT  aud=sts.amazonaws.com<br/>sub=repo:Surya-yerasi@61959369/extemers@1405205156:environment:dev
    J->>STS: AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity(role ARN, JWT)
    STS->>R: verify issuer, aud, sub conditions
    alt sub matches (PR → plan role, env dev → deploy role)
        R-->>STS: allow
        STS-->>J: temporary credentials (≤ 1 h)
    else any other branch / fork / environment
        R-->>STS: deny
        STS-->>J: AccessDenied
    end
